  partName: Front Gasket
  description: The Front Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned at the
    middle-center-front of the engine, serving as a seal between engine components
    to prevent fluid leaks and maintain pressure. Made from Material.001, it provides
    a reliable and durable seal. Notably, the Front Gasket's thin-flat design allows
    for a precise fit, ensuring a tight seal and preventing engine damage due to
    fluid leaks.
